PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt's templated native path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Sharing/` has NO matching
Xcode target. The Apple app is a single SwiftUI source root `apps/apple/Sources/`
(project.yml `sources: - path: Sources`) shared by the iOS + macOS app targets, with tests
under `apps/apple/Tests/Unit`. Same reconciliation as the p4-apple dashboard-widget logs.
To actually compile + test under the gate, the surface was placed in the real compiled
roots and decomposed one-concern-per-file (swiftlint file_length <= 400):

  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveReport.swift       (pure SI value types + unit math + formatters)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveProjection.swift   (pure route/chart projection)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDrivePageState.swift    (pure render-state derivation)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDrivePageModel.swift    (@Observable P1/S8 binding + KMP boundary)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDrivePage.swift         (entry View + lifecycle)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveReportView.swift   (loaded report body)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveRouteMap.swift     (hero MapKit map)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveCharts.swift       (elevation + speed Swift Charts)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveStatsGrid.swift    (7 stat cards + vehicle badge)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharedDriveStateViews.swift   (loading/expired/empty/no-route)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Sharing/SharingRouteRegistration.swift(.sharing register + /s/:token parse)
  apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Sharing/SharedDriveProjectionTests.swift    (18 unit tests, KMP-free)
  apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings                     (+20 share.* keys, +5 supporting)

Data binds to the shared P1/S8 `SharingStore.sharedDrive(token:) -> StateFlow<Resource<SharedDrive>>`
via `StateHolderModel`/`LoadableState` (no HTTP in the view). The `SharedDrive` union
(`SharedDriveData` SI/v2 | `SharedDriveDataV1` legacy) is normalized to SI at the boundary,
mirroring the web `normalizeSharedDriveData`. Units convert at the render boundary through the
shared `Units` engine + the pure shared-drive helpers (P1/S5). i18n: 20 share.* keys added to
Localizable.xcstrings. Navigation: `SharingRouteRegistration.registry(store:token:)` hosts the
public report at the `.sharing` route; `token(from:)`/`token(fromPath:)` resolve `/s/:token`.
Live wiring into TeslaSyncApp awaits the deferred `AppContainer.bootstrap(baseURL:)` (the whole
app data-graph bootstrap is deferred by design; only `.settings`, which is UserDefaults-backed,
is wired live today) — the registration + parser are real, tested seams the bootstrap calls.

States reproduced: loading (TSPageLoader), expired/error (web ExpiredShareView + Retry + home),
empty (ContentUnavailableView, share.noMapData), success (full report). Panels never blank:
absent optionals render an em dash; chart containers show an empty overlay; the no-route panel
(GlassPanel11) appears only when there is no route/elevation/speed data (web parity).

